</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Our Company was incorporated in the British Virgin
Islands on February 21, 2023, under the Companies Act as a company with limited liability. The Company is authorized to issue an unlimited
number of shares, divided into Class A Shares of no-par value, and Class B Shares of no-par value (up to a maximum of 5,000,000 Class
B Shares). As of December 31, 2025, there are 1,361,726 (68,086,178 prior to 50-for-1 reverse share split) Class A Ordinary
Shares issued and outstanding and 5,000,000 Class B Ordinary Shares issued and outstanding. On February 3, 2025, the Company issued 43,000
(2,150,000 prior to 50-for-1 reverse share split) Class A ordinary shares of the Company to certain employees, executive and consultants
under the Company&#8217;s 2024 Share Incentive Plan. On December 5, 2025, the Company issued an aggregate of 27,000 (1,350,000 prior to
50-for-1 reverse share split) Class A Ordinary Shares under the Company&#8217;s 2024 Share Incentive Plan and an aggregate of 130,000
(6,500,000 prior to 50-for-1 reverse share split) Class A Ordinary Shares under the Company&#8217;s 2025 Share Incentive Plan to certain
employees, executive and individual consultants for their continued service in the Company.</p><div>
