YY Smart iClean App helps customers to make data-driven decisions, which lead to more efficient and cost-effective restroom cleaning
operations. In turn, the YY Smart iClean App provides our customers with an innovative, up to date solution to enhance their cleaning
and janitorial services and improve the overall user experience.&#160;</span></p><div>

