</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On December 5, 2025, the Company issued an aggregate
of 27,000 (1,350,000 prior to 50-for-1 reverse share split) Class A Ordinary Shares under the Company&#8217;s 2024 Share Incentive Plan
and an aggregate of 130,000 (6,500,000 prior to 50-for-1 reverse share split) Class A Ordinary Shares under the Company&#8217;s 2025 Share
Incentive Plan to certain employees, executive and individual consultants for their continued service in the Company.</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On December 31, 2025, the Company, by a resolution
of the shareholders pursuant to Regulation 7.21 of the Company&#8217;s articles of association, approved and adopted the Amended and Restated
