</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">We
are also exposed to liquidity risk which is risk that we are unable to provide sufficient capital resources and liquidity to meet our
commitments and business needs. Liquidity risk is controlled by the application of financial position analysis and monitoring procedures.
When necessary, we will turn to other financial institutions, trade receivable factoring agent and related parties to obtain short-term
funding to meet the liquidity shortage.</span></p><div>

