<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
July 1, 2025, the Company entered into a Share Purchase Agreement (&#8220;SPA&#8221;) with a third-party individual (the &#8220;Vendor&#8221;)
to acquire <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c270" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:PercentageOfVotingEquityInterestsAcquired" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-54601">100</ix:nonFraction>% of the issued ordinary shares in Pest Fighter, a company incorporated in Singapore (Company Registration No. 199405733M).
