<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Investment
properties consist of three commercial units owned by Transocean Oil Pte. Ltd. (&#8220;Transocean&#8221;) and one commercial unit owned
by Mediaplus Venture Group Pte. Ltd. (&#8220;Mediaplus&#8221;). These properties are held to generate rental income and for long-term
capital appreciation and are leased to third-party tenants under non-cancellable lease arrangements.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="yygh:DisclosureOfReconciliationOfTheCarryingAmountTableTextBlock" id="ixv-38752"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Reconciliation
