2027</ix:nonNumeric> and have an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c437" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yygh:ExercisePrice" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-55377">240</ix:nonFraction> ($<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c437" decimals="1" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ExercisePriceOfOutstandingShareOptions2019" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-55378">4.8</ix:nonFraction> prior to 50-for-1 reverse share split). US Tiger Securities Inc. can elect to have cashless
