the Company granted the warrant holders a pro rata participation right of one third in any subsequent placement (subject to certain exemptions)
undertaken by the Company for the period from the date of the repurchase agreements through December 11, 2026.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

