a purchase price of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c875" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yygh:SecuredPromissoryNoteAndSharePledgePurchasePrice" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-56286">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction>, which principal amount included an original issue discount of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c875" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yygh:SecuredPromissoryNoteAndSharePledgeOriginalIssueDiscount" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-56287">80,000</ix:nonFraction> and an origination fee of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c875" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yygh:SecuredPromissoryNoteAndSharePledgeOriginationFee" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-56288">20,000</ix:nonFraction>.
