</div><ix:continuation id="_DisclosureOfEventsAfterReportingPeriodExplanatory-c0_cont_1"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Convertible
