A ordinary shares. The notes have a <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c878" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" name="yygh:TermOfNotes" id="ixv-56296">24</ix:nonNumeric>-month term and bear interest at <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c878" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yygh:PercentageOfNoteBearsInterestPerAnnum" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-56297">10</ix:nonFraction>% per annum (subject to increase upon an event of default),
