<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">During March 2026, holders exercised
a series of partial conversions of the Convertible Notes and exercises of the Warrants. An aggregate principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c879" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:NotionalAmount" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-56300">375,000</ix:nonFraction> of Convertible
Notes, together with approximately $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c880" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:InterestExpenseOnDebtInstrumentsIssued" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-56301">760</ix:nonFraction> of accrued interest, was converted into an aggregate of <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c881" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yygh:NumberOfSharesConvertedIntoOrdinaryShares" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-56302">76,347</ix:nonFraction> (<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c882" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yygh:NumberOfSharesConvertedIntoOrdinaryShares" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-56303">3,817,336</ix:nonFraction> prior to 50-for-1 reverse
